<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-20T13:19:56.389Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:19:56 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have seized the Bab al-Mandeb strait and nearby positions after Yemeni government troops withdrew, placing them within about 60 km of Aden. Saudi-backed forces have responded with intensified air strikes on dozens of Houthi military sites and increased pressure on Taiz. The Houthis launched missile attacks that damaged the Saudi sovereign wealth fund headquarters and the tallest tower in Riyadh, prompting the coalition to intercept additional missiles targeting the capital and southern Saudi Arabia. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168830&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOa0hZSmpRQXJwM2pNbUxHY01JZUd1TkdjdU5YNGZYd1hqMmNES3RoTWRCVm9GYjMwX0x5NkMwb2FicHNjWkhMZ1dQUVNsUW1hblVuQjVLVkhlVUZZRDFiMlcxdWNweTV0NjR6TG43MmFYMjczckZ1SmhzSlZtOFdtZVVsNHZpSk1UVWdRZ0phakNPT05NRUxmOFFmNGtMZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBPZVNTVWJGd3ZpZzNHcmdiMEYzYjNfcmc4Ri1KNWhnV3l6SnZfbzVhWU1jbmwyQjlrTXd2enBpd3JwNjVYYS1ramJnSDR1U1VkdWFyaTd3SWgtSHM?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxORThXT3I5QnpTVGwxaTdQek9zdk1MUUxYTWhqbTItZFNHNGZZMFdGdVpURWRSdE1NbDBZQmVxVkV6MF9BSHBFRWpIQ1Zlb2NoSFRTM09ldmRlTEU5U3FTUzFvUEtTTnMtZjMtM1M1WTNfWmxpMVdNbXhKeGJ3OTdUVTJQN0I5NnFFdmN0ZnpxYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOLTZuZ0xuU04xbTZ1eXZoYzllSUhZam41eGd5MFdyNExieFZzcktpUUZMTWhwam1fN21TS1lSYVlOOHh5ZTFxQ3lFSDRISUE3ak82cVBUcUk1VWlfTUNNZWx3dVhKVH